<p>A profile is seen as a 40-pixel circle, so it is a face and one mark: the portrait, a hairline ring just inside the edge, and the recording-light dot in the accent at the top right — the same dot the logo carries. Put any photograph in <code>im-studio-photo</code>; everything else is drawn.</p>
